OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA rather grey start with some
OL,6,Fspots of rain or drizzle, especially
OL,7,Ftowards the east. Skies brightening up
OL,8,Fthough throughout the morning, with
OL,9,Fsunshine developing by the afternoon.
OL,10,FRain however will return in the far
OL,11,Fnorthwest later.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FRain will spread across the
OL,14,Fcountry throughout the evening and
OL,15,Fnight, turning heavy and persistent in
OL,16,Fplaces. Turning drier and clearer in
OL,17,Fthe northwest towards dawn.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
