OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FOvernight rain clearing east
OL,6,Fduring the morning, with brighter
OL,7,Fskies following. A scattering of
OL,8,Fshowers then moving in for the
OL,9,Fafternoon, some of which maybe heavy.
OL,10,FBreezy and feeling cooler.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FDrier
OL,13,Fand brighter on Wednesday with spells
OL,14,Fof sunshine. Another band of rain then
OL,15,Fmoves in for Thursday, before drier
OL,16,Fand brighter weather returns on
OL,17,FFriday. Temperatures likely around
OL,18,Faverage.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
